              "text": "न्यायालयः — nyāyālayaḥ — \"a court of law\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अधिवक्ता प्रातः न्यायालयं गच्छति। adhivaktā prātaḥ nyāyālayaṃ gacchati. The lawyer goes to court in the morning."
