          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "न्यायालयः (nyāyālayaḥ) is a modern word built from nyāya, \"rule, right manner\", and ālaya, \"a house, an abode\"; MW records the parts but not the compound (MW)."
